@base = http://localhost:8085

### List all three seeded books
GET {{base}}/api/books
Accept: application/json

### Author fragment and limit
GET {{base}}/api/books?author=Bloch&limit=1

### Find one book
GET {{base}}/api/books/1

### A missing book is 404
GET {{base}}/api/books/999

### Create a book: 201 and Location /api/books/4 on a fresh start
POST {{base}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Pro Spring 6","author":"Cosmina","year":2023}

### Replace the new book: 200
PUT {{base}}/api/books/4
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Pro Spring 6 Updated","author":"Cosmina Harrop","year":2024}

### Delete it: 204
DELETE {{base}}/api/books/4

### Repeat deletion: 404
DELETE {{base}}/api/books/4

### Title-fragment search: ignores case
GET {{base}}/api/books/search?title=JAVA

### Empty search result: 200 and []
GET {{base}}/api/books/search?title=NoSuchTitle

### Non-numeric path ID: 400
GET {{base}}/api/books/abc

### Unknown URL: 404
GET {{base}}/api/nothing

### Wrong method for the collection: 405
DELETE {{base}}/api/books

### Wrong request media type: 415
POST {{base}}/api/books
Content-Type: text/plain

This is not JSON.

### Unsupported response media type: 406
GET {{base}}/api/books
Accept: application/xml

### Form POST: 302, then browser GET 200 with one flash message
POST {{base}}/books
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

title=Java+Precisely&author=Peter+Sestoft&year=2016

### Refresh: GET does not create a duplicate
GET {{base}}/books
